                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I'm standing up for the 330,000+ people in MA-01 who rely on Medicaid to receive health care.\n\nI'm standing up for the 224,000+ people in MA-01 who rely on SNAP to receive nutritious food.\n\nI'm standing up for the 11,000+ students in MA-01 who rely on Pell grants to make college more affordable.\n\nThe Republicans are trying to bankroll another billionaire tax cut on the backs of children, seniors, veterans, and working families.\n\nWe can defeat the Big, Ugly Bill. We just need four Republicans to do the right thing and stand with the American people by voting no.",
