                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Ahead of tomorrow\u2019s 60th anniversary of Medicaid and Medicare, it was a privilege to be at the Life Care Center of Wilbraham, emphasizing the importance of these programs and what\u2019s at stake with the Republican agenda.\n\nMedicaid and Medicare are essential promises to the people \u2013 ones we must sustain and expand, not cut.\n\nhttps://t.co/wKuYbsP1lU",
