                "quoted_status_profile_username": "NBCNews",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Safety is paramount; we all want safe communities, but that is not what this is about.\n\nThe Trump administration is looking for a distraction from their harmful economic agenda, one that takes healthcare away from millions of families & increases costs for everyday Americans.",
