                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans had no problem extending tax cuts for the billionaire class earlier this year.\n\nNow, they have a choice: lower costs and protect the healthcare of millions of Americans, or shut down the government.\n\nFor @HouseDemocrats, the choice is clear. We will always stand up and defend the healthcare of American families.",
