                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thanks to the Affordable Care Act and enhanced premium tax credits, Democrats delivered health care to millions of Americans - 24.3 million to be exact.\n\nNow, President Trump and Republicans have a choice: protect the health insurance of millions, or shut down the government.\n\nIn MA-01, 29,000 people face higher health care costs. Democrats are ready to negotiate a deal that lowers costs for American families. Where are Republicans?",
