                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Whether it be an increase in health insurance premiums, a cut to SNAP or WIC benefits, or being furloughed from their jobs, thousands of MA-01 residents will be impacted by a Republican shutdown.\n\nRepublicans had no problem permanently extending tax cuts earlier this year for the wealthiest among us. Now, as millions of Americans are about to pay the price, Democrats are left waiting for a Republican Party that is willing to come to the table and do the work the American people elected them to do.",
