                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As time goes on, the details of the President\u2019s \u201cBig, Ugly Bill\u201d keep getting uglier.\n\nNot only did this bill mark the largest health care cut in our nation\u2019s history, it also included a provision that weakened Medicare\u2019s ability to negotiate lower drug prices for seniors\u2014a hallmark of the Inflation Reduction Act.\n\nIt's clear where Republican priorities lie, and it's not with America's seniors.",
