                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As notices continue to be sent out, 29,000 people in MA-01 will soon get the news that the cost of their health insurance is going up\u2014significantly.\n\nWhy? Republicans can extend tax cuts for the wealthiest Americans, but not health care credits that make insurance affordable for millions.\n\n@HouseDemocrats will not be party to this blatant attack. We will always stand up to protect your health care.",
