                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Yesterday, I met with local hospitals and community leaders across MA-01 to discuss the impact of the President's One Big, Ugly Law, and Republicans' refusal to extend ACA enhanced credits.\n\n\u274c 31,000+ residents will lose their health insurance\n\u274c 30,000+ residents who receive coverage through the ACA will see their premiums double or triple\n\nPeople are paying more for less coverage. Extending the ACA tax credits isn\u2019t optional. It\u2019s essential.",
